context Entry(entry) v1
description "The one command, ritsu, and each language's own command after its name (ritsu); the same in a page in the browser (ritsu-wasm)"

owns
  dir "../crates/ritsu", "../crates/ritsu-wasm"

upstream Base conformist
  through ritsu_base, ritsu_units, ritsu_proto, ritsu_emit, ritsu_ports

upstream Project conformist
  through ritsu_project

upstream Borders conformist
  through ritsu_cross

upstream Rules conformist
  through rulec

upstream Workflows conformist
  through dandori

upstream Calendars conformist
  through koyomi

upstream Books conformist
  through chobo

upstream Claims conformist
  through geas

upstream Requirements conformist
  through yuen

upstream ContextMaps conformist
  through sakai
